      "value": "@{5a69eccdd20e79665351e7c1|full_name}: The creator isn't mistaken. You've listed a detailed work around for the issue which does indeed work but it only does so by disabling / overriding the default VRC blinking.\n\nUsing a workaround and fixing the bug that requires it are two different things.",
